  "text": "Here is a misconception worth clearing up right away. MCP does not replace REST APIs, databases, or local files—and AI models could already do function calling before MCP existed. Instead, MCP sits right in between as one universal adapter, standardizing how any AI host discovers available capabilities and safely runs those calls against your existing systems without bespoke glue code.",
